(6278317, 929033, 112828, '<td valign="top">Sorry to hear this is scoring so poorly for you Richard (yes I know this is yours, too darn distinctive not to be yours, coupled with your comment, it''s easy to figure out).<br/> <br/>Soo,  I think the fact that you placed the cabin on the rule of 1/3rds is screwing with people, and the even land/sky proportion is also getting them..<br/> <br/>As for me?  That cabin is WAY to heavy for the scene, it completely overwhelms the shot..  Deserves much better IMO.</td>', 'Sorry to hear this is scoring so poorly for you Richard (yes I know this is yours, too darn distinctive not to be yours, coupled with your comment, it''s easy to figure out). Soo,  I think the fact that you placed the cabin on the rule of 1/3rds is screwing with people, and the even land/sky proportion is also getting them.. As for me?  That cabin is WAY to heavy for the scene, it completely overwhelms the shot..  Deserves much better IMO.', '2011-01-10 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278331, 929261, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is exceptional.  Truly marvelous lighting, pose, and the enigmatic silhouette profile.  Is it his vision.  Is it her nightmare?  Splendidly conceived and art directed.</td>', 'This is exceptional.  Truly marvelous lighting, pose, and the enigmatic silhouette profile.  Is it his vision.  Is it her nightmare?  Splendidly conceived and art directed.', '2011-01-10 01:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
