(6278334, 929071, 96751, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if this is out of balance, but it sure makes me feel that way.  Awesome pp''ing and colors.</td>', 'Don''t know if this is out of balance, but it sure makes me feel that way.  Awesome pp''ing and colors.', '2011-01-10 01:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278336, 929285, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the natural raindrop-on-window filter.  Not a clue of this is considered "out of balance", but a nice moody image.  I like the curve of the snow and the punctuation of her figure.</td>', 'Love the natural raindrop-on-window filter.  Not a clue of this is considered "out of balance", but a nice moody image.  I like the curve of the snow and the punctuation of her figure.', '2011-01-10 01:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278337, 928307, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflections in the water.  Is it out of balance.  I''m not the one to ask.</td>', 'Awesome reflections in the water.  Is it out of balance.  I''m not the one to ask.', '2011-01-10 01:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278338, 929275, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great slice of life.  Nice conversion.</td>', 'Great slice of life.  Nice conversion.', '2011-01-10 01:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278339, 929297, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I love this image because it has a kitty in it.  And then something that''s not a kitty and much smaller than a kitty.</td>', 'LOL!  I love this image because it has a kitty in it.  And then something that''s not a kitty and much smaller than a kitty.', '2011-01-10 01:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278343, 928532, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!!!  I''m guessing that''s a runner with a light of some sort?  Brilliantly lit and gorgeous colors.  The stars are also a nice element and add a lot of texture to an otherwise large, negative space.  The tilt tops it off.</td>', 'Gorgeous!!!  I''m guessing that''s a runner with a light of some sort?  Brilliantly lit and gorgeous colors.  The stars are also a nice element and add a lot of texture to an otherwise large, negative space.  The tilt tops it off.', '2011-01-10 01:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278347, 928768, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think it''s always safe to go with an abstract.  This one is a delicious concoction of geometry and tones.</td>', 'I think it''s always safe to go with an abstract.  This one is a delicious concoction of geometry and tones.', '2011-01-10 01:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278353, 928789, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh goodness.  This is so marvelous in so many ways.  The ghostliness of the dog, the tonal range, the graniness, and the uncertainty of having seen a loved one or merely his ghost.  There is something very <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">roz</a> about this image.</td>', 'Oh goodness.  This is so marvelous in so many ways.  The ghostliness of the dog, the tonal range, the graniness, and the uncertainty of having seen a loved one or merely his ghost.  There is something very  roz about this image.', '2011-01-10 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278354, 929271, 96751, '<td valign="top">Freaky!!!!  I love it.</td>', 'Freaky!!!!  I love it.', '2011-01-10 01:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278356, 928206, 96751, '<td valign="top">AKA "Kilroy was Here"...  I love how clean this image is.  Nice lines, and it really makes me want to know what''s "up there".</td>', 'AKA "Kilroy was Here"...  I love how clean this image is.  Nice lines, and it really makes me want to know what''s "up there".', '2011-01-10 01:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278360, 928570, 96751, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS use of dof.  The contrasting color intensity is also wonderful, and really creates more than just geographic distance between them.</td>', 'FABULOUS use of dof.  The contrasting color intensity is also wonderful, and really creates more than just geographic distance between them.', '2011-01-10 01:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278361, 929183, 96751, '<td valign="top">Um, toenail clipper...?  Hmmm, I seem to remember someone broke there ankle around here recently...</td>', 'Um, toenail clipper...?  Hmmm, I seem to remember someone broke there ankle around here recently...', '2011-01-10 01:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278364, 929286, 96751, '<td valign="top">The tones here are just GLORIOUS.</td>', 'The tones here are just GLORIOUS.', '2011-01-10 01:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278366, 928994, 96751, '<td valign="top">So sweet and silly.  Incredibly rich and lovely tones.  Wonderful captured moment.</td>', 'So sweet and silly.  Incredibly rich and lovely tones.  Wonderful captured moment.', '2011-01-10 01:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278369, 929092, 96751, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image.  At first glance I was ready to dismiss it, but the blur of his leg got me, and then I had to explore the rest.</td>', 'Intriguing image.  At first glance I was ready to dismiss it, but the blur of his leg got me, and then I had to explore the rest.', '2011-01-10 01:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278371, 929191, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.', '2011-01-10 01:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278373, 929216, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Lovely colors.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Lovely colors.', '2011-01-10 01:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278381, 928542, 96751, '<td valign="top">Classic example of negative space.  Although not totally negative.  The blurred branches and the tones are wonderful, and the tiny bird pointing straight into the void totally anchors the image.</td>', 'Classic example of negative space.  Although not totally negative.  The blurred branches and the tones are wonderful, and the tiny bird pointing straight into the void totally anchors the image.', '2011-01-10 01:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278391, 928975, 96751, '<td valign="top">How ADORABLE!!!!</td>', 'How ADORABLE!!!!', '2011-01-10 01:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278392, 928117, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a macro!!</td>', 'That''s quite a macro!!', '2011-01-10 01:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278393, 929318, 96751, '<td valign="top">The color here is SO unexpected.  I''m not used to motion blur in color.  Very effective, wonderful image.</td>', 'The color here is SO unexpected.  I''m not used to motion blur in color.  Very effective, wonderful image.', '2011-01-10 01:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278396, 928793, 40391, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a>?<br/> <br/>Many elements here are out of balance but not enough to remove the interest and lovely aspect of the image.<br/> <br/>If it is Judi, haven''t you learned not to make light of the floods ;-)</td>', ' Judi? Many elements here are out of balance but not enough to remove the interest and lovely aspect of the image. If it is Judi, haven''t you learned not to make light of the floods ;-)', '2011-01-10 01:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278397, 929269, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yummm.  Actually, the more I look at it, the more it looks like Jabba the Hutt.  And now that I''ve said that I can''t unsee him.  So very odd, and likeable.</td>', 'Yummm.  Actually, the more I look at it, the more it looks like Jabba the Hutt.  And now that I''ve said that I can''t unsee him.  So very odd, and likeable.', '2011-01-10 01:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278398, 929231, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love he quality and texture of the clouds, and the crescent moon trying to get comfortable on the edge of that dark object.</td>', 'I love he quality and texture of the clouds, and the crescent moon trying to get comfortable on the edge of that dark object.', '2011-01-10 01:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278399, 928679, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes!!</td>', 'Beautiful eyes!!', '2011-01-10 01:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278401, 928140, 96751, '<td valign="top">How did you do this!!!??  Awesome new technique to explore.  This might be my fave "outre" image.  But I''m not done yet :-)</td>', 'How did you do this!!!??  Awesome new technique to explore.  This might be my fave "outre" image.  But I''m not done yet :-)', '2011-01-10 01:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278402, 928183, 96751, '<td valign="top">Things look SO strange when they''re inverted.</td>', 'Things look SO strange when they''re inverted.', '2011-01-10 01:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278403, 928486, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome how we can see the terminator line between night and day.</td>', 'Awesome how we can see the terminator line between night and day.', '2011-01-10 01:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278404, 929232, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  Took me a moment, but I figured it out (with help from the title).  Very organic looking thing whose texture is misleading.  Fabulous capture.</td>', 'Oh wow.  Took me a moment, but I figured it out (with help from the title).  Very organic looking thing whose texture is misleading.  Fabulous capture.', '2011-01-10 01:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278405, 928635, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this just might be a pinhole capture.  And if so, it might be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> or even <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54646" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">spurgeon</a>.  And if not, take that as the highest compliment.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately (for this challenge), it is wonderfully balanced and deliciously nuanced.  The delicacy of the top branches is breathtaking.</td>', 'I''m thinking this just might be a pinhole capture.  And if so, it might be  bvy or even  spurgeon.  And if not, take that as the highest compliment. Unfortunately (for this challenge), it is wonderfully balanced and deliciously nuanced.  The delicacy of the top branches is breathtaking.', '2011-01-10 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278406, 929019, 96751, '<td valign="top">Haunting, and very Poe-ish for some reason.  This looks like it was Topazed and then converted.  Love the sharpness and richness of the structure, against the diaphanous sky.  The bird is the punctuation to this story.</td>', 'Haunting, and very Poe-ish for some reason.  This looks like it was Topazed and then converted.  Love the sharpness and richness of the structure, against the diaphanous sky.  The bird is the punctuation to this story.', '2011-01-10 01:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278407, 929278, 96751, '<td valign="top">Life leaving it''s mark on the world.  Wonderful lines shrouded in the mystery of blotches.</td>', 'Life leaving it''s mark on the world.  Wonderful lines shrouded in the mystery of blotches.', '2011-01-10 01:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6278408, 929272, 96751, '<td valign="top">How wonderful.  Pixilation as fine art.</td>', 'How wonderful.  Pixilation as fine art.', '2011-01-10 01:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
