(6278438, 929076, 96751, '<td valign="top">When I saw this thumbnail, I couldn''t wait to get to it.  What an inspired creation.  I don''t know where to look first or where to start.  Perhaps with the blaze that is the illuminating sun of this image, radiating outward and in circular sweeps to touch the reaching fingertips and the softly arching back of The Thing.  The animal which knows no species.  The Cat/Dog/Lamb that has awakened to the dual warming delights of a touch and a ray.  My pick for the PH blue.</td>', 'When I saw this thumbnail, I couldn''t wait to get to it.  What an inspired creation.  I don''t know where to look first or where to start.  Perhaps with the blaze that is the illuminating sun of this image, radiating outward and in circular sweeps to touch the reaching fingertips and the softly arching back of The Thing.  The animal which knows no species.  The Cat/Dog/Lamb that has awakened to the dual warming delights of a touch and a ray.  My pick for the PH blue.', '2011-01-10 02:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
