(6283279, 928768, 61396, '<td valign="top">I hope people did notice the cup went out of balance (spilling some white on the edge of the dark surface), and are not DNMC you just because the picture as a whole is so well balanced.</td>', 'I hope people did notice the cup went out of balance (spilling some white on the edge of the dark surface), and are not DNMC you just because the picture as a whole is so well balanced.', '2011-01-14 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6283309, 929279, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a fun capture.  Love the Dali ''stache and how it echoes the two circles of his sunglasses.  Pity about the brick wall, which I feel is significantly detracting.  I would highly encourage you to edit this for non-DPC use.</td>', 'What a fun capture.  Love the Dali ''stache and how it echoes the two circles of his sunglasses.  Pity about the brick wall, which I feel is significantly detracting.  I would highly encourage you to edit this for non-DPC use.', '2011-01-14 11:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6283310, 929043, 96751, '<td valign="top">Glorious eyes.  Sadly, this is one of the most balanced images in the challenge, LOL!  Kitty creates an almost perfect diagonal with her back and top of head, and almost perfectly fits the corner with her triangular face.  I''m not dinging any image in this challenge for DNMC because I still can''t figure out what an oob IS!!!<br/> <br/>Also, I''d fix the tiny reflection on her lower lip so that it''s not the same green as her eyes...</td>', 'Glorious eyes.  Sadly, this is one of the most balanced images in the challenge, LOL!  Kitty creates an almost perfect diagonal with her back and top of head, and almost perfectly fits the corner with her triangular face.  I''m not dinging any image in this challenge for DNMC because I still can''t figure out what an oob IS!!! Also, I''d fix the tiny reflection on her lower lip so that it''s not the same green as her eyes...', '2011-01-14 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
