(6283677, 929052, 123833, '<td valign="top">Unbalanced but I am not sure it is effective ie. that the left counter-balances the bird, very nice photo though, 6<br/>On the third pass - it is balanced! I just realized the snow is more prominent on the left and white is very noticeable. Up to 7</td>', 'Unbalanced but I am not sure it is effective ie. that the left counter-balances the bird, very nice photo though, 6On the third pass - it is balanced! I just realized the snow is more prominent on the left and white is very noticeable. Up to 7', '2011-01-14 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
