(6284288, 929272, 39111, '<td valign="top">Is this a light?  Oh, I see, one is burned out but you''re saying there''s still enough light?  I don''t understand why it''s so grainy.  The composition is not very interesting for me either.</td>', 'Is this a light?  Oh, I see, one is burned out but you''re saying there''s still enough light?  I don''t understand why it''s so grainy.  The composition is not very interesting for me either.', '2011-01-16 00:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
