(6284291, 928768, 39111, '<td valign="top">Way too blurry for me to get anything meaningful out of it, or anything at all really. Even with the title, I still don''t see it.</td>', 'Way too blurry for me to get anything meaningful out of it, or anything at all really. Even with the title, I still don''t see it.', '2011-01-16 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
