(6284293, 929179, 39111, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast for my taste and I don''t get the point of it being so peachy in color, doesn''t seem to add to the picture.</td>', 'Not enough contrast for my taste and I don''t get the point of it being so peachy in color, doesn''t seem to add to the picture.', '2011-01-16 00:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
