(6284295, 928308, 39111, '<td valign="top">Uhhhh...they are nice colors but otherwise I don''t know what to say.  I suppose it''s more like abstract art and I shouldn''t try.</td>', 'Uhhhh...they are nice colors but otherwise I don''t know what to say.  I suppose it''s more like abstract art and I shouldn''t try.', '2011-01-16 00:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6284296, 928301, 39111, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh with the shiny wall, and the keyboard and cord are distracting.  Also, is that a piece of paper behind the keyboard?  It''s a bit of a mess IMHO.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh with the shiny wall, and the keyboard and cord are distracting.  Also, is that a piece of paper behind the keyboard?  It''s a bit of a mess IMHO.', '2011-01-16 00:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6284297, 929316, 39111, '<td valign="top">This is the opposite of out of balance.  Either way, I''d like more contrast and I don''t see how the white circle of light serves the overall image in any way.</td>', 'This is the opposite of out of balance.  Either way, I''d like more contrast and I don''t see how the white circle of light serves the overall image in any way.', '2011-01-16 00:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6284298, 929261, 39111, '<td valign="top">I find this image a little too contrived for my taste.  I also don''t really feel like I get it, I guess like a poem I might not understand - which doesn''t mean it''s a bad poem, just means I don''t get it.</td>', 'I find this image a little too contrived for my taste.  I also don''t really feel like I get it, I guess like a poem I might not understand - which doesn''t mean it''s a bad poem, just means I don''t get it.', '2011-01-16 00:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
