(6285731, 928532, 123989, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your votes! Pretty happy with 18th. Room for improvement. Someone had said that they would like to see the shot without the light streak. I do have that shot also. If you would like to see it just let me know. Someone else had stated that the shot would be in balance if it wasn''t tilted. Well, that''s up for interpretation and I think you could make a similar argument for 90% of the photos in this challenge. <br/> <br/>Second ever submission and cracked a 6 so thank you again for your votes!</td>', 'Thanks for your votes! Pretty happy with 18th. Room for improvement. Someone had said that they would like to see the shot without the light streak. I do have that shot also. If you would like to see it just let me know. Someone else had stated that the shot would be in balance if it wasn''t tilted. Well, that''s up for interpretation and I think you could make a similar argument for 90% of the photos in this challenge.  Second ever submission and cracked a 6 so thank you again for your votes!', '2011-01-17 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
