(6286419, 929249, 66384, '<td valign="top">I thought you nailed the out of balance aspect, and did it so elegantly. I love the drape of the skirt. I even like the color, but my experience with slight green/blue tints has been negative with the voters (I''ve quit using them on DPC). I had no idea this was you. It makes it all the more special, knowing it is a self portrait. I gave this a 10 and still think it deserves a ribbon.<br/> <br/>P.S. No streaks show on my monitor.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-17 23:21:20.</i></td>', 'I thought you nailed the out of balance aspect, and did it so elegantly. I love the drape of the skirt. I even like the color, but my experience with slight green/blue tints has been negative with the voters (I''ve quit using them on DPC). I had no idea this was you. It makes it all the more special, knowing it is a self portrait. I gave this a 10 and still think it deserves a ribbon. P.S. No streaks show on my monitor.', '2011-01-17 23:20:17.000000', '2011-01-17 23:21:20.000000', 0),
